ds": ["music", "action", "Role", "TowerDefense", "fighting"], "long_description": "There is a multiverse in the game, currently consisting of the Sweet Universe, the Metaverse, the Blackstone Universe, the Free Universe, and the Tesla Universe.\n\nIn the latest update, LoveSweet entered the second chapter, the Metaverse, the Battle of the Metaverse. In this chapter, players will hold the sword of benevolence and righteousness to eliminate the invading enemies.\n\nThe story takes place in the Metaverse, which is being invaded by the Black Rock Legion. They successfully parasitized and controlled XR by releasing a parasitic virus. They ordered XR to devour other peace-loving races in the entire universe. All creatures in the universe are facing the fate of being completely devoured and becoming dominated slaves. This universe needs heroes to save it. Join the most powerful resistance forces in the Metaverse, VR and AR, to resist this enslaved future!", "short_description": "LoveSweet enters the second chapter. In this chapter, players will hold the sword of benevolence and righteousness to destroy the invading enemies.\nPS\uff1aThere are a lot of bugs in the current version, we will speed up the repair. Tomorrow is the Chinese New Year, we have to take a holiday, I wish you all good health and smooth work!"}]}, "developer_name": "TangJunlong", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.jkou.net/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TangJunlong", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.jkou.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "ART_CREATIVITY", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recomme